# Vital Clarity Design System

Never use arbitrary hex values. Use tokens from the Tailwind config in each file's `<head>`.

## Color intent

| Token / value | Use |
|---|---|
| `primary` (#005bbf) | CTAs, nav active, trust signals |
| `tertiary` / `tertiary-container` | Medication alerts, pill cards, urgent UI |
| `#00a651` (inline or safelist) | Hydration, positive progress |
| `surface-container-lowest` (#ffffff) | Card backgrounds |
| `inverse-surface` (#1e333c) | Dark feature cards |

## Typography

Lexend only. Use utilities: `text-display`, `text-headline-lg`, `text-headline-md`, `text-body-lg`, `text-body-md`, `text-label-lg`, `text-label-sm` — never raw px.

## Spacing & shape

- Tokens: `container-padding` (24px), `stack-gap` (16px), `inline-gap` (12px), `section-margin` (32px)
- Buttons: `rounded-xl` (large), `rounded-full` (pill/nav CTAs)
- Cards: `rounded-lg`; feature highlights: `rounded-xl`
- Shadow: `soft-shadow` only — never `box-shadow-lg` or hard dark shadows
